gametitle=Manhunt (Europe) [SLES-52023] v1.03 PAL
// CRC FE419424. Every patch site was checked against SLES_520.23 from this disc on 2026-11-04.
// Code credits: Codejunkies (Action Replay MAX, PAL, listed on GameHacking.org game/101937).
// Raw PCSX2 form posted by GoggleBug on ps2-home.com (viewtopic t=4458), tested on a real PS2 (SCPH-39003).
// Status: [TESTED] = confirmed in game memory on PCSX2 (Nov 4 2026). [UNTESTED] = patch confirmed applied, but the effect was not
// seen yet: Infinite Health only takes effect when a level starts (not from a save state); the ammo/reload codes need firing
// and reloading to confirm; First Person Mode did not change the camera in testing.
// Conversion, checks and labels: IRISHDEVELOPERDEV. No master code is needed in PCSX2.

[Infinite Health]
author=Codejunkies (raw form by GoggleBug, ps2-home.com)
description=[UNTESTED] SAFE. Turns on the game's own God Mode flag on Cash every frame. Patches the flag test at 0x457D28 in the built-in cheat handler.
patch=1,EE,20457D28,extended,24030001

[Infinite Stamina (Infinite Run)]
author=Codejunkies (raw form by GoggleBug, ps2-home.com)
description=[TESTED] SAFE. Writes 1.0 to the stamina value at 0x550FAC every frame. Uses two unused nop slots at 0x112F70; $at is already 0x550000 there.
patch=1,EE,20112F70,extended,3C023F80
patch=1,EE,20112F74,extended,AC220FAC

[Infinite Ammo (No Clip Drain)]
author=Codejunkies (raw form by GoggleBug, ps2-home.com)
description=[UNTESTED] SAFE. Removes the clip decrement at 0x266808, so the clip never goes down. This is shared weapon code, so hunters also never run dry.
patch=1,EE,20266808,extended,00000000

[Infinite Reload]
author=Codejunkies (raw form by GoggleBug, ps2-home.com)
description=[UNTESTED] SAFE. Reloading refills the clip without taking from reserve ammo. Removes the subu at 0x267750.
patch=1,EE,20267750,extended,00000000

[Infinite-Max Ammo (99)]
author=Codejunkies (raw form by GoggleBug, ps2-home.com)
description=[UNTESTED] EXPERIMENTAL. Sets reserve and clip to 99 when the weapon ammo check runs (0x1B0728). Can go past normal clip sizes. Use either this or the two codes above, not both.
patch=1,EE,201B0728,extended,24030063
patch=1,EE,201B072C,extended,AE630098
patch=1,EE,201B0730,extended,AE6300A0

[Hunters Ignore You (Low AI)]
author=Codejunkies (raw form by GoggleBug, ps2-home.com)
description=[TESTED] EXPERIMENTAL. Sets the two AI perception flags (0x5ADC38, 0x5ADC3C) that the game's own unlockable cheats set. Hunters mostly fail to see or hear you. Scripted events can still trigger.
patch=1,EE,205ADC38,extended,00000001
patch=1,EE,205ADC3C,extended,00000001

[Open All Levels]
author=Codejunkies (raw form by GoggleBug, ps2-home.com)
description=[TESTED] SAFE (progress). Sets the unlock byte (+0x54) in each of the 20 level records in the save block (0x5E1EB0, record stride 0xB0). Auto-save writes this to the memory card, so back up the card first. The source used 16-bit writes; byte writes are used here to leave +0x55 alone.
patch=1,EE,005E1F04,byte,01
patch=1,EE,005E1FB4,byte,01
patch=1,EE,005E2064,byte,01
patch=1,EE,005E2114,byte,01
