[All Levels Max Stars]
author=Codejunkies (raw form by GoggleBug, ps2-home.com)
description=[TESTED] EXPERIMENTAL (progress). Sets a 5-star rating (16-bit, record +0x58) on all 20 levels, which unlocks the bonus features and cheats menu. The +0x58 field could not be traced in code. Auto-save writes this to the memory card, so back up first.
patch=1,EE,105E1F08,extended,00000005
