[First Person Mode]
author=Codejunkies (raw form by GoggleBug, ps2-home.com)
description=[UNTESTED] EXPERIMENTAL. Camera tweak from the same set: removes two branches in the camera code (0x330618, 0x33062C). May clip or look odd in cutscenes.
patch=1,EE,20330618,extended,00000000
patch=1,EE,2033062C,extended,00000000
